  },
  {
    "id": 1009001000710020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへ、レッスンを頑張ってて良かったです！",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100071/1009001000710020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。それだけ頑張ってるんなら……",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "どんどん\r\n上手くなりそうだな",
    "nextLabel": "1009001000711"
  },
  {
    "select": "誰かに教えることも\r\nできるんじゃないか",
    "nextLabel": "1009001000712"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "もっと\r\n褒めてもらえるように\r\nなろうな！",
    "nextLabel": "1009001000713"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001000710030,
    "label": "1009001000711",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ、先生にも言われました！\r\nプロデューサーさんも、そう思ってくれますか？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100071/1009001000710030"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001000710040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、もっとレッスン頑張って、\r\nもっとカッコよく踊れるようになりたいです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100071/1009001000710040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（よし、楽しく話せたな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001000710050,
    "label": "1009001000712",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そうなんです！\r\n同じ班の子が教えてほしいって言ってくれました！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100071/1009001000710050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001000710060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "いつも教えてもらってるあたしが教えるなんて、\r\n不思議で、ちょっと照れちゃいました。えへへ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communications/100900100071/1009001000710060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まぁ、普通に話せたかな）",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009001000710070,
    "label": "1009001000713",
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "はい！　あ、でもその後のかけっこでは、\r\n１番になれなかったんです",
